  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8504.03 Replacement Envelopes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8504.03 Replacement Envelopes.\n\n(a) Participants shall receive one blue envelope.\n\n(b) If an issued Blue Envelope is lost or stolen, the director may issue a replacement envelope to participants with a valid DMSV 653“Blue Envelope Request Form” (rev 07/26) or a valid DSMV 643 “Medically Recognized Disorder Indication” (rev 07/26) form on file.\n\nSource. #14643, INTERIM, eff 7-3-26, EXPIRES: 12-30-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8500.html"
}
